    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d26-a2">

                <pb facs="0039" n="33" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg33"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 27.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Otori to Mr. Gardner.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Seoul</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-07-15"><hi rendition="#italic">July 15,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to your note of to-day’s date
                    respecting the assault said to have been made against you and some others by
                    some Japanese in military uniforms, I have the honor to assure you in the first
                    instance that I have taken immediate steps to investigate the case.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">K. Otori</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
